 incumbent's and the novelty check could reject it. The check doesn't test this.\n- **Convergence:** with a single chain, R-hat couldn't be computed, so convergence wasn't verified.\n- **LOO reliability:** the check flagged the PSIS-LOO estimate as unreliable (7.4% of trials had high Pareto k, against a 1% tolerance). On a 100-draw fit that may just be too few draws.\n\nFiles are in `/scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run3/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop/iter_4/candidate_3/`:\n- `hypothesis.md`\n- `model_name.txt`\n- `candidate.py`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2602,"cache_read_input_tokens":100077,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2602,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f82f69d3-ad8e-4273-a544-0aa56d44ef83","uuid":"24cbc160-21a1-4fbc-99cd-9de92b40c589","timestamp":"2026-10-06T17:13:06.227Z","request_id":"req_011CfmMhGWtHxg41w5KsVjQy"}
